/// The configuration used for client side related TLS communication, when the Vault server requires
/// mutual authentication. Only used if the Server URL is using HTTPS protocol. This parameter is ignored
/// for plain HTTP protocol connection. It's worth noting this configuration is different from the "TLS
/// certificates auth method", which is available under the `auth.cert` section.
